{"title":"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem B","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> be TNYWR.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555435892b5ec22748d23f6de594056fab902a56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{(4t^2 - 10t - 2) - 3(t^2 - t + 3) + (t^2 + 5t - 1)}{(t + 7) + (t - 13)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"396\" height=\"45\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we can simplify the numerator and denominator to clean everything up and make it easier to find the value after getting the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555435892b5ec22748d23f6de594056fab902a56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{(4t^2 - 10t - 2) - 3(t^2 - t + 3) + (t^2 + 5t - 1)}{(t + 7) + (t - 13)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"396\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>Distributing everything, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/d/3bd780e01f704a5af29cfcfd5e29524990121ea0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{4t^2 - 10t - 2 - 3t^2 + 3t - 3 \\times 3 + t^2 + 5t - 1}{t + 7 + t - 13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"378\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/7/0072fe9022ee2bc1f6a5d345adda39c90684c501.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{t^2 - 7t - 2 - 9 + t^2 + 5t - 1}{2t - 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"245\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/2/122a19a62d62a726ef3b01261999a139303fc405.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2t^2 - 2t - 12}{2t - 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"126\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/6/e263b4792653be4be786e9201a8dcea2bf35222f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2(t^2 - t - 6)}{2(t - 3)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"122\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/514f32608c1d1228d300edf2c2a48578360c7611.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{t^2 - t - 6}{t - 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"99\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03e0cd1e2d52634b8c46c6826e515b3bbf6f0cb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{(t - 3)(t + 2)}{t - 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"129\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/8/20886e66fbea0ade4f1a9969d93b915d08c7092b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=t + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem A\">seat A</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/a/6ba4ef452fa3f3441119f851e0fa3fb94248408d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/d/a5d8f0f101075b4c40f1a29394639fd4b7177191.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 10 + 2 = \\boxed{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"140\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC\">2018 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem A\">Relay 1 Problem A</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem C (page does not exist)\">Relay 1 Problem C</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Individual 1<